<!-- 7 · FAQ -->
<section class="faq">
  <div class="faq-inner">
    <div class="faq-head fade-up">
      <span class="label">Your Questions, Answered</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title">Frequently Asked <em>Questions</em></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list fade-up">
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-q"><h3>How do I choose a perfume for the UAE climate?</h3><span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">add</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-a">Start with the temperature. For hot, humid days pick fresh and citrus scents in lighter concentrations, and save rich oud, amber and spice for cooler evenings. Our climate edits group them for you.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-q"><h3>How does weather affect how a perfume smells?</h3><span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">add</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-a">Heat lifts and speeds up a fragrance, so scents feel stronger and fade faster in UAE summers. Cold air holds them closer to the skin, which is why the same perfume can smell different across seasons.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-q"><h3>What perfume is best for hot, humid weather?</h3><span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">add</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-a">For hot, humid weather, choose fresh, citrus, aquatic and light floral scents in lighter concentrations. They stay crisp without turning heavy, so your fragrance feels clean and comfortable through a UAE summer day.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-q"><h3>Should I change my perfume by season?</h3><span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">add</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-a">You do not have to, but many people do. Lighter, fresher scents suit summer heat, while warmer oud, amber and spice come alive in cooler months. A small seasonal rotation keeps you comfortable year round.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-q"><h3>Why does my perfume smell different in summer?</h3><span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">add</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-a">Warmth and humidity change how a fragrance evaporates from your skin. In summer, top notes burn off faster and the scent can feel sharper or heavier than the same perfume does in cooler winter air.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-q"><h3>Do you ship internationally?</h3><span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">add</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-a">Yes. The Fragrance Secrets ships across the UAE and also delivers to customers in the United States and Canada. Shipping options and delivery estimates are available during checkout.</div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

